That's the WoY.  You get to Vlad's tower by finding a maze level with
two up staircases.  One goes up to the next higher maze level, the
other to Vlad's Tower.

>There is a large square area in the centre of the screen, and
>I can't dig through the walls or walk through when polymorphed
>into a xorn.
>
There is only one way in.

>In the centre of this is a sort of cross-shaped moat with the
>alleged Wizard in the centre.
>
>When I go down below the third tower level there is a sort of
>shop level.  I've searched this level again and again and can't
>find another stairway up or a portal.
>
I believe this is the ghost town.  Lots of undead + shades + skeletons
+ maybe Orcus?  If so, the portal you seek is not there.

>Do I just have to keep exploring downward until I find a way up
>into the tower?  I've gone down to about level 55 without finding
>anything but I'm not sure what I'm looking for.
>
You're looking for a level with a small "room" in the center surrounded
by a moat.  You can dig into this room.  The portal is in the middle of
the room.  (There are often two or more such levels; only one has
the portal.)

